{
  "$comment": "Single source of canonical and forbidden names. Edit this file, then `npm run build:naming` (regenerates naming-dictionary.md); `npm run check:naming` validates the shape, freshness of the .md and greps sources for `forbidden`. Names use the starter placeholders (prefix `starter`, core `starter-core`, theme `starter`); `npm run init` (tools/init.mjs) replaces them once per project.",
